title:    What builds the week
subtitle: Six files. The two scripts are the measuring instrument, and they found more than the experiment did.
width:    1180
---
week-24-chaos-engineering-fis/
|
+-- terraform/
|   +-- environments/dev/main.tf          106   HCP backend, OIDC, wires the two modules
|   +-- modules/service/main.tf           293   ECS Fargate service, ALB, and the two alarms
|   +-- modules/chaos/main.tf             310   FIS role, log group, three experiment templates
|
+-- scripts/
|   +-- run-experiment.sh                 184   starts an experiment and records what happened,
|   |                                           every 2s, through to full recovery
|   +-- summarise.py                      129   turns a recording into the numbers, and refuses
|                                               to print one it cannot stand behind
|
+-- docs/
    +-- FINDINGS.md                       183   four ways the experiment reported success
                                                while proving nothing
